-       detail
+       detail

-           Each case's `number` is the error's sub-number:
+           `number` каждого кейса — подномер ошибки:

-           ```tabular
+           ```tabular

-           column  Case
-           column  Code
-           column  Message
-           column  Note
+           column  Кейс
+           column  Код
+           column  Сообщение
+           column  Примечание

-           row  `UnclosedGroup`  1  _a capturing group was not closed_
+           row  `UnclosedGroup`  1  _a capturing group was not closed_

-           row  `ExpectedGroup`  2  _a capturing group was expected immediately following an extractor_  a `$name` with no group after it
+           row  `ExpectedGroup`  2  _a capturing group was expected immediately following an extractor_  `$name` без группы после него

-           row  `BadRepetition`  3  _the maximum number of repetitions is less than the minimum_
+           row  `BadRepetition`  3  _the maximum number of repetitions is less than the minimum_

-           row  `Uncapturable`  4  _a capturing group inside a repeating group can not be extracted_
+           row  `Uncapturable`  4  _a capturing group inside a repeating group can not be extracted_

-           row  `UnexpectedChar`  5  _the repetition range contained an unexpected character_
+           row  `UnexpectedChar`  5  _the repetition range contained an unexpected character_

-           row  `NotInGroup`  6  _a closing parenthesis was found without a corresponding opening parenthesis_
+           row  `NotInGroup`  6  _a closing parenthesis was found without a corresponding opening parenthesis_

-           row  `IncompleteRepetition`  7  _the repetition range was not closed_
+           row  `IncompleteRepetition`  7  _the repetition range was not closed_

-           row  `InvalidPattern`  8  _the pattern was invalid_  anything `java.util.regex` rejects that the parser did not
