-           row  `UnclosedEscape`  9  _nothing followed the escape character `\`_
+           row  `UnclosedEscape`  9  _nothing followed the escape character `\`_

-           row  `EmptyCharClass`  10  _the character class is empty_
+           row  `EmptyCharClass`  10  _the character class is empty_

-           row  `ZeroMaximum`  11  _the maximum number of repetitions must be greater than zero_
+           row  `ZeroMaximum`  11  _the maximum number of repetitions must be greater than zero_

